OL,3,GNEWSASon appeals over missing parents
OL,4,Aafter floods in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who says he has not heard from
OL,7,Fhis parents since the floods in Nepal
OL,8,Fhas appealed to the Foreign Office to
OL,9,Fwork with Chinese authorities to get
OL,10,Fborder logs verified.
OL,12,FAnant Patel, 29, believes Bipin and
OL,13,FMala Patel, from Coventry, who have
OL,14,Fbeen on a pilgrimage, crossed into
OL,15,FTibet from Nepal before a landslide hit
OL,16,Fthe Gyirong border crossing on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,19,FHe said he was staying as positive as
OL,20,Fpossible and the family was "pulling
OL,21,Ftogether as one to make sure we all get
OL,22,Fthrough this."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
