OL,3,GNEWSASon appeals over missing parents
OL,4,Aafter floods in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Foreign, Commonwealth & Development
OL,7,FOffice (FCDO) confirmed that their
OL,8,Fconsular team have spoken to Anant.
OL,9,FThey said: "We recognise this is a
OL,10,Fdistressing time and are working around
OL,11,Fthe clock to support families and loved
OL,12,Fones of British nationals missing in
OL,13,Fthe floods."
